Hello, Robi@ipn,

That is not two-dimensional item response model. One is response variables, another is the design matrix what indicate where NA values included. Within Two-dimensional models, all variables are 'response variables', not 'design matrix' indicates which one is null.

See this if you available;
http://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1111/j.2044-8317.2005.tb00312.x/epdf
https://www.ets.org/Media/Research/pdf/RR-10-11.pdf

Seongho

